Per the FCC 'manual' (datasheet)... *'''Transmitter Output Power (802.11a)''' **802.11a (5150 to 5250MHz): 15.70 dBm **802.11a (5725 to 5850MHz): 25.26 dBm *'''Receiver Sensitivity (802.11a)''' (Error rate = 10% at room temperature) **-82 dBm @ 6Mbps **-81 dBm @ 9Mbps **-79 dBm @ 12Mbps **-77 dBm @ 18Mbps **-74 dBm @ 24Mbps **-70 dBm @ 36Mbps **-66 dBm @ 48Mbps **-65 dBm @ 54Mbps *'''Transmitter Output Power (802.11n)''' **5150 to 5250MHz ***802.11n MCS0 20MHz: 16.06 dBm ***802.11n MCS0 40MHz: 16.87 dBm **5725 to 5850MHz ***802.11n MCS0 20MHz: 25.57 dBm ***802.11n MCS0 40MHz: 25.56 dBm *'''Receiver Sensitivity (802.11n)''' **HT20 ***-82 dBm @ MCS0/8/16 ***-79 dBm @ MCS1/9/17 ***-77 dBm @ MCS2/10/18 ***-74 dBm @ MCS3/11/19 ***-70 dBm @ MCS4/12/20 ***-66 dBm @ MCS5/13/21 ***-65 dBm @ MCS6/14/22 ***-64 dBm @ MCS7/13/23 **HT20 ***-79 dBm @ MCS0/8/16 ***-76 dBm @ MCS1/9/17 ***-74 dBm @ MCS2/10/18 ***-71 dBm @ MCS3/11/19 ***-67 dBm @ MCS4/12/20 ***-63 dBm @ MCS5/13/21 ***-62 dBm @ MCS6/14/22 ***-61 dBm @ MCS7/13/23 *'''Transmitter Output Power (802.11ac)''' **5150 to 5250MHz ***802.11ac MCS0 VHT 20MHz: 15.81 dBm ***802.11ac MCS0 VHT 40MHz: 16.85 dBm ***802.11ac MCS0 VHT 80MHz: 15.13 dBm **5150 to 5250MHz ***802.11ac MCS0 VHT 20MHz: 25.29 dBm ***802.11ac MCS0 VHT 40MHz: 25.51 dBm ***802.11ac MCS0 VHT 80MHz: 24.96 dBm *'''Receiver Sensitivity (802.11ac)''' **VHT20 ***-82 dBm @ MCS0 ***-79 dBm @ MCS1 ***-77 dBm @ MCS2 ***-74 dBm @ MCS3 ***-70 dBm @ MCS4 ***-66 dBm @ MCS5 ***-65 dBm @ MCS6 ***-64 dBm @ MCS7 ***-59 dBm @ MCS8 ***-57 dBm @ MCS9 **VHT40 ***-79 dBm @ MCS0 ***-76 dBm @ MCS1 ***-74 dBm @ MCS2 ***-71 dBm @ MCS3 ***-67 dBm @ MCS4 ***-63 dBm @ MCS5 ***-62 dBm @ MCS6 ***-61 dBm @ MCS7 ***-56 dBm @ MCS8 ***-54 dBm @ MCS9 **VHT40 ***-76 dBm @ MCS0 ***-73 dBm @ MCS1 ***-71 dBm @ MCS2 ***-68 dBm @ MCS3 ***-64 dBm @ MCS4 ***-60 dBm @ MCS5 ***-59 dBm @ MCS6 ***-58 dBm @ MCS7 ***-53 dBm @ MCS8 ***-51 dBm @ MCS9
